WEBVTT

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:06.046
It looked as though Yamucha

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:10.509
had been victorious over one of the Saibaimen.

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:12.177
However...

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:20.269
Hey, get that filthy, tattered mess cleaned up.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:24.815
At length, Kuririn's anger explodes!

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.904
Dokkan Dokkan tsuite'ru

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:34.074
Dokkan Dokkan paradise

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:38.203
Genki dama ga hajiketobu ze

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:41.623
Go Go Let's do it

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:48.630
Ugomeku ayashii enajii

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:54.595
yousha wa shinai ze mite'ro yo

00:00:54.679 --> 00:01:00.559
Inochi ni kaete mo mamoru yo

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:06.732
Ai suru yuuki wo tsuyosa ni kaero

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:12.738
Yarinuku kiai de pinchi wo koete'ku

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:19.995
Tegowai yatsu hodo wakuwaku mo dekkai ze

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:24.208
Dokkan Dokkan tsuite'ru

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:27.503
Dokkan Dokkan chansu sa

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:33.133
Rakkii no kaze ni byunbyun notte

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:36.095
Dokkan Dokkan tsuite'ru

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:39.348
Dokkan Dokkan ashita mo

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:46.480
kotae wo mou tamashii wa shitte'ru no sa

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:50.192
Dragon Soul!

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:59.201
"Sit Tight, Chaozu!
Tenshinhan's Screaming Kikoho."

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:11.588
Let me show you the results of my training!

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:17.219
Go!

00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:26.353
What's with the slow-motion blast?

00:02:50.211 --> 00:02:51.670
You got them!

00:02:51.754 --> 00:02:53.714
Wow, amazing!

00:02:53.798 --> 00:02:56.008
Kuririn, are you okay?

00:02:56.092 --> 00:02:59.928
Yeah... but I missed one of them.

00:03:07.937 --> 00:03:09.563
To hell with you!

00:03:22.785 --> 00:03:25.245
That's Piccolo for you.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:29.583
Just thinking that he might be our
enemy again gives me the chills.

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:32.377
Thank you, Piccolo-san.

00:03:32.462 --> 00:03:35.756
Don't get the wrong idea.
As if I would rescue you.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:41.386
I was just warming up for the
wonderful fight that's about to begin.

00:03:44.515 --> 00:03:47.935
Let's hope that's how the fight turns out.

00:03:55.318 --> 00:04:01.114
Well then, as you wish, shall we
put an end to the fun and games?

00:04:02.659 --> 00:04:05.202
The real battle is about to begin.

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:10.749
I-Impossible! They aren't fazed at all!

00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:14.044
I-I hit them at full power!

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:20.008
That's what Saiyans are like?!

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:31.895
Let me take them. I'll finish off
all five of them in an instant.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:35.607
Suit yourself. However...

00:04:35.692 --> 00:04:38.694
Do not kill the Namekian.

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:43.407
We have to get information about
the Dragon Balls out of him afterward.

00:04:43.491 --> 00:04:47.160
Okay then, do your best
to make this entertaining.

00:04:47.245 --> 00:04:49.204
I'll start...

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:52.582
...with you!

00:04:54.085 --> 00:04:55.877
Let me handle this!

00:05:08.766 --> 00:05:10.684
Piccolo-san!

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:15.564
It looks like this is going to be sort of fun.

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:17.858
W-What?

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:42.090
T-The whole ground is shaking...

00:05:44.344 --> 00:05:46.887
I-It's no use, Ten-san!

00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:51.600
My supernatural powers have no effect!

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:53.894
T-This can't be!

00:05:56.481 --> 00:06:01.234
H-How can this be? I had no
idea it would be this bad!

00:06:07.784 --> 00:06:10.952
Hurry! Hold on, guys!

00:06:33.935 --> 00:06:35.602
All right...!

00:06:39.607 --> 00:06:41.691
Chaozu, watch yourself!

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:08.760
Tenshinhan!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.222
Dodge him!

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.436
Ten-san!

00:07:25.445 --> 00:07:27.112
What fragile folks these are.

00:07:27.196 --> 00:07:29.698
Now to finish you!

00:07:33.494 --> 00:07:35.328
Damn you!

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:45.464
Tenshinhan-san!

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:54.264
Damn it! Tenshinhan!

00:07:54.348 --> 00:07:56.683
Wait! He's had it! Let him be!

00:07:56.767 --> 00:07:58.477
Shut up!

00:08:00.104 --> 00:08:02.314
Stay out of this!

00:08:28.466 --> 00:08:30.175
I can't see the bottom of the hole...

00:08:30.259 --> 00:08:34.262
Unbelievable! What a
tremendous energy wave!

00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:37.057
D-Damn...

00:08:37.141 --> 00:08:40.310
Nappa, look behind you!

00:08:44.148 --> 00:08:46.233
--Chaozu!
--Why, you...!

00:08:46.317 --> 00:08:48.276
You little punk!

00:08:58.079 --> 00:09:00.872
Chaozu! Get away from him!

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:07.462
Chaozu, that's enough! Get away from him!

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:09.965
T-Ten-san...

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:14.427
Thank you...

00:09:14.512 --> 00:09:19.558
W-What are you talking about, Chaozu?!

00:09:19.642 --> 00:09:22.811
Get out of there! Hurry and get out of there!

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:32.404
I enjoyed being together with you.

00:09:35.366 --> 00:09:40.453
Chaozu! What are you thinking of doing?!

00:09:46.627 --> 00:09:52.674
Farewell, Ten-san. Please don't die.

00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:56.469
Stop! Chaozu!!

00:10:14.405 --> 00:10:17.157
Ten-san!

00:10:24.332 --> 00:10:27.709
Chaozu!!

00:10:31.631 --> 00:10:33.590
He blew himself up, taking them both out.

00:10:33.674 --> 00:10:35.925
A pretty drastic thing to do.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.845
Nice work, for the little guy.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:59.199
That was a worthless thing to do.

00:10:59.283 --> 00:11:05.080
N-No way! How can he still
be fine?! That's terrible!

00:11:05.164 --> 00:11:09.042
Chaozu even gave up his own life!

00:11:10.628 --> 00:11:15.757
Chaozu... h-has already been brought
back to life once with the Dragon Balls!

00:11:15.841 --> 00:11:21.221
He can't ever be brought
back to life again! Damn it!

00:11:21.305 --> 00:11:23.682
I swear you'll pay for this!

00:11:26.727 --> 00:11:31.731
It looks like you still don't
realize how terrifying we are.

00:11:31.816 --> 00:11:35.860
All that remains for you is death!

00:11:57.466 --> 00:12:00.760
I-It had no effect at all!

00:12:00.845 --> 00:12:04.389
Chaozu won't be able to rest in peace!

00:12:10.396 --> 00:12:12.063
Chaozu...

00:12:13.149 --> 00:12:16.985
Be grateful. I'll send you to see
him in the next world, right away!

00:12:21.031 --> 00:12:23.867
Y-You'll pay for this!

00:12:23.951 --> 00:12:26.911
I swear you'll pay for this!

00:12:53.189 --> 00:12:57.233
A-At this rate, Tenshinhan-san
will be done in as well!

00:12:57.318 --> 00:12:59.527
I have to do something!

00:12:59.612 --> 00:13:01.905
Stop!

00:13:01.989 --> 00:13:05.742
We'll have a brief opening during
the instant when he moves to attack.

00:13:05.826 --> 00:13:08.411
Wait for that moment.

00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:10.371
Got that, Gohan?

00:13:11.874 --> 00:13:13.208
Yes...

00:13:13.292 --> 00:13:15.376
That's a good strategy.

00:13:15.461 --> 00:13:18.213
Best of luck with that.

00:13:18.297 --> 00:13:21.216
Are you sure you should be looking away?

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.134
You'll miss your chance.

00:13:23.219 --> 00:13:25.220
Heh, you sure are sure of yourself.

00:13:25.304 --> 00:13:30.266
But you'll stop making that stupid
face once Son Goku gets here.

00:13:30.351 --> 00:13:35.939
Ho? Who's that? Your ace-in-the-hole?

00:13:37.233 --> 00:13:39.192
Just you wait and see.

00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:50.703
Looks like that's all for you, huh?

00:13:50.788 --> 00:13:53.873
I'll come put you out of your misery, right now.

00:14:03.717 --> 00:14:05.802
See you in hell!

00:14:08.305 --> 00:14:10.473
Now! Scatter, Kuririn and Gohan!

00:14:10.558 --> 00:14:12.016
Yeah!

00:14:14.395 --> 00:14:17.438
I'm gonna finish you! Die!

00:14:20.484 --> 00:14:21.943
What?!

00:14:25.573 --> 00:14:28.074
Gohan! Now! Shoot him!

00:14:32.121 --> 00:14:33.538
Gohan!

00:14:33.622 --> 00:14:35.665
Get yourself ready!

00:14:37.084 --> 00:14:39.752
I-I'm too scared!

00:14:50.806 --> 00:14:52.223
You filthy brat!

00:14:52.308 --> 00:14:54.058
It's not working!

00:15:05.112 --> 00:15:08.364
We missed him! Our timing was too late!

00:15:09.533 --> 00:15:15.580
Now you've done it! You've just
shortened your own lives even more!

00:15:15.664 --> 00:15:20.543
Fine. I've decided to change
the order that I kill you in!

00:15:20.628 --> 00:15:23.046
Say your prayers!

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:27.967
I-I'm sorry... Uncle Piccolo...

00:15:29.261 --> 00:15:32.096
What is wrong, Kami-sama?

00:15:32.181 --> 00:15:36.309
Hmm, it would seem my life
will only last a little longer.

00:15:36.393 --> 00:15:40.480
Death... death is closing in on me.

00:15:40.564 --> 00:15:44.317
You cannot mean...

00:15:44.401 --> 00:15:46.653
Piccolo is going to be killed.

00:15:46.737 --> 00:15:49.447
And so is everyone else.

00:15:49.531 --> 00:15:51.407
W-What about Goku?

00:15:51.492 --> 00:15:55.745
Hmm... I still don't sense his presence.

00:15:55.829 --> 00:15:57.830
Goku, hurry!

00:15:59.291 --> 00:16:01.834
Ch-Chaozu...!

00:16:05.297 --> 00:16:08.925
We've always fought together...

00:16:09.009 --> 00:16:11.552
...and now, you can't be brought back to life!

00:16:16.058 --> 00:16:19.268
Ten-san... I'm sorry...

00:16:23.983 --> 00:16:25.858
Chaozu...!

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:31.698
You were fools to upset me.

00:16:33.367 --> 00:16:37.203
Now, which one of you will I toy with first?

00:16:37.287 --> 00:16:42.625
I'll leave the Namekian just barely alive.

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:46.713
Have to get more about the
Dragon Balls out of you, after all.

00:16:48.757 --> 00:16:51.592
Chaozu... I will avenge you,

00:16:51.677 --> 00:16:53.594
and then I will be coming!

00:16:53.679 --> 00:16:57.390
I won't leave you there feeling lonely!

00:16:57.474 --> 00:17:02.061
This is... this is my... last...

00:17:04.606 --> 00:17:10.194
K-Kikoho!!

00:17:23.751 --> 00:17:26.210
Oh, did he get him?!

00:17:45.773 --> 00:17:47.774
Don't startle me like that!

00:17:47.858 --> 00:17:50.860
I-It had no effect on him!

00:17:50.944 --> 00:17:53.237
That monster! Is he immortal?!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:59.285
C-Confound it...

00:18:10.798 --> 00:18:12.048
Fool!

00:18:12.132 --> 00:18:14.342
He could have just stayed down,

00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:17.011
but he used up all his power,
and died for nothing.

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:21.057
O-Oh, no... not Tenshinhan, too...

00:18:21.141 --> 00:18:23.017
This is horrible... It's a nightmare...

00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:26.145
Everyone is dying, one after another...

00:18:27.981 --> 00:18:32.110
Goku!! Get here, quick!!

00:18:32.194 --> 00:18:34.612
Goku!!

00:18:34.696 --> 00:18:35.822
Hurry!

00:18:35.906 --> 00:18:37.865
Hurry!!

00:18:39.284 --> 00:18:42.078
Goku?

00:18:42.162 --> 00:18:45.164
Why do you keep saying--

00:18:45.249 --> 00:18:46.999
Hold on...

00:18:48.752 --> 00:18:53.548
I put another one of you away.
Now, it's your turn!

00:18:53.632 --> 00:18:55.800
Let's get back on the ground and fight.

00:18:55.884 --> 00:18:59.804
He's far better at fighting
in mid-air than we are.

00:19:02.057 --> 00:19:04.225
It'll be the same, either way.

00:19:04.309 --> 00:19:06.561
Flounder about, flounder about!

00:19:08.814 --> 00:19:10.523
Here goes!

00:19:10.607 --> 00:19:13.985
--Here he comes!
--Father!

00:19:14.069 --> 00:19:16.696
Nappa! Wait!

00:19:19.825 --> 00:19:22.410
W-What?! Why won't you let me at them?!

00:19:22.494 --> 00:19:26.455
Don't be hasty. There's a little
something I want to ask them.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:30.209
This "Son Goku" you keep
talking about is Kakarrot, right?

00:19:30.294 --> 00:19:33.129
That's right! So what if he is?!

00:19:35.841 --> 00:19:39.177
To think that your last
resort would be Kakarrot!

00:19:39.261 --> 00:19:41.596
What good will he do once he gets here,

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.265
when he didn't stand a
chance against even Raditz?

00:19:44.349 --> 00:19:49.061
He's not like he was before!
He's gotten much, much stronger!

00:19:49.146 --> 00:19:52.440
Don't you go making light of Son Goku!

00:19:54.902 --> 00:19:57.862
For all of that, he doesn't
seem to be coming, does he?

00:19:57.946 --> 00:20:00.656
Are you sure he hasn't
gotten scared, and run away?

00:20:00.741 --> 00:20:04.744
H-He'll be here! My father
will be here for sure!

00:20:04.828 --> 00:20:07.413
And he's going to beat you guys up!

00:20:07.497 --> 00:20:10.124
That's some faith you have in him.

00:20:10.209 --> 00:20:13.586
This should be interesting.
We'll wait until he gets here.

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:17.465
You're kidding, right?! Let's put
these guys away, right now!

00:20:17.549 --> 00:20:20.009
However, we'll only give him three hours.

00:20:20.093 --> 00:20:22.720
We won't wait any longer than that.

00:20:22.804 --> 00:20:25.848
This is ridiculous! I'm going to play now!

00:20:27.017 --> 00:20:30.269
Nappa! Didn't you hear what I said?!

00:20:31.939 --> 00:20:36.150
S-Sorry. I got a little carried away there...

00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:38.027
That's the deal. You should be grateful.

00:20:38.111 --> 00:20:40.947
You'll get to live a little while longer.

00:20:50.874 --> 00:20:54.919
You can't blame him. This is
his first real fight, after all.

00:20:55.003 --> 00:20:58.422
Hmph! What a sap I am for
expecting anything out of you.

00:20:58.507 --> 00:21:00.675
Get lost, you pantywaist.

00:21:03.262 --> 00:21:07.056
I have to say, though, the way that
big guy was cowering just now...

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:08.975
Does that mean the runt there, Vegeta,

00:21:09.059 --> 00:21:12.853
is even more ridiculously strong?

00:21:12.938 --> 00:21:16.774
I'm aching to do something!
I can't wait any longer!

00:21:16.858 --> 00:21:20.069
Now, hold on. Three more hours.

00:21:20.153 --> 00:21:23.948
In three hours, we'll be witness
to a hellish horror show.

00:21:24.032 --> 00:21:27.243
Three hours until the battle resumes.

00:21:27.327 --> 00:21:30.413
Will Goku make it in time?

00:21:31.915 --> 00:21:34.834
Yaburekabure omoikiri

00:21:34.918 --> 00:21:39.422
Tobu n da mugen no sora e

00:21:39.506 --> 00:21:42.341
Jetto kiryuu ni nokkari

00:21:42.426 --> 00:21:45.469
doko demo iku yo sokkou

00:21:45.554 --> 00:21:47.805
Mukoumizu tte saikou

00:21:47.889 --> 00:21:51.225
Let's go tip-top! All right?

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:57.106
Me mo sameru you na aoi chikyuu

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:03.279
kakegaenai kono hoshi yuzurenai kara

00:22:04.656 --> 00:22:07.616
Hajiketobase kamehameha

00:22:07.701 --> 00:22:10.870
Yabame no kono jidai

00:22:10.954 --> 00:22:16.584
sekai wo mamoru tame umareta kara

00:22:16.668 --> 00:22:19.587
Yaburekabure omoikiri

00:22:19.671 --> 00:22:22.798
Yaru n da furupawaa

00:22:22.883 --> 00:22:26.844
Kibou ga ore no buki dakara

00:22:26.928 --> 00:22:30.181
mirai shinjite

00:22:34.353 --> 00:22:36.270
Heya! I'm Goku!

00:22:36.355 --> 00:22:38.814
All right, I've made it to the
end of the Serpentine Road.

00:22:38.899 --> 00:22:40.816
I've almost made it to
where everyone else is.

00:22:40.901 --> 00:22:43.069
But we're already at our limit here.

00:22:43.153 --> 00:22:45.529
We'll just have to hold out
until Goku gets here.

00:22:45.614 --> 00:22:50.201
Ah, I can feel Father's Ki!
He's coming after all!

00:22:50.285 --> 00:22:52.328
Next time on Dragon Ball Z Kai,

00:22:52.412 --> 00:22:56.332
"Will Son Goku Be in Time?!
Three Hours Until the Battle Resumes."

00:22:56.416 --> 00:22:59.502
P-Piccolo-san, why?!
